WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.540
 Space, the final frontier.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.000
 These are the voyages of the starship Enterprise.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.120
 Its five-year mission, to explore strange new worlds.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.140
 To seek out new life and new civilization.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.380
 To boldly go where no man has gone before.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:15.680
 Captain's log start date 1254.4.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:21.440
 For years, scientists have theorized that if our galaxy was created from a great explosion,

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.440
 then the center of the galaxy might still be creating new matter.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.940
 The Enterprise is now on a science mission to investigate.

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:33.120
 It's an awesome thought that we may actually witness matter being created.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:38.540
 If we do, Captain, we may also encounter forces and phenomena beyond our understanding.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.260
 Galaxy Center, Captain.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.360
 Lieutenant Uhura, sound yellow alert.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.200
 Aye, sir.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:44.380
 Yellow alert.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:50.260
 All stations report yellow alert readiness, sir.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:51.040
 Captain.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:56.400
 The creation point.

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:58.860
 An extraordinary phenomenon, Captain.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:03.140
 Reverse power.

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:04.480
 Hold out position.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:05.580
 Deflector screen's on.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:06.560
 Deflector's up.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.460
 Sir, it's taking considerable power to hold position.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.300
 Charting scanners on, Captain.

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.140
 Beginning science survey.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:17.920
 Jim.

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:18.840
 Spock.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:21.140
 What in the name of sanity is going on?

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:23.760
 We're here, bones.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.260
 And the theories about this place seem to be right.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:33.200
 Captain.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.080
 That thing's pulling us in.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.460
 I'm up to warp six.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:40.640
 Scanners indicated some form of matter energy whirlwind, Captain.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.000
 Warp seven, Captain.

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:44.700
 Warp eight.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.660
 Take us out of here, Mr. Sulu.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:48.120
 Still being drawn in, Captain.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:48.920
 Warp nine.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:49.880
 Warp ten.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:51.920
 Emergency reverse power.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:04.840
 Captain, I don't know how much more emergency power we can take before we start to break up.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.420
 There may be only one choice.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.100
 We must hope this whirlwind is like its atmospheric counterparts.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.280
 But there is calm at its center.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:15.100
 Agreed.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.440
 We'll try to make for the eye of the storm.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.360
 Allow me.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.240
 Engineering, report.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.180
 Everything can be repaired, Captain.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.560
 An incredible experience, Captain.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:47.060
 I find this scientifically fascinating.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.180
 At least I have the good sense to be scared, Jim.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:51.280
 What now?

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.760
 We'll ride her through, bones.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:53.620
 What else can we do?

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:55.160
 Ride her through where?

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.400
 Through the center of things, Doctor.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:01.160
 Through what may be the center of everything.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:15.860
 Where are we?

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:20.060
 I'm afraid our navigational coordinates mean very little here, Lieutenant.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:25.280
 My readings indicate we are not in time and space as we understand it.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:29.060
 Doctor, these readings may interest you.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.640
 Captain, the subspace radio.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.060
 It's dead.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.620
 Even the ship's chronometers have stopped.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:38.900
 Captain, there's no reason for it, but the engines are fading out.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:44.280
 Apparently, the natural laws of our universe don't operate here, Captain.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.960
 Ship's life, support systems, fading.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.500
 Jim, we need oxygen.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:56.080
 Elmsman, emergency battery power.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.900
 There's none, Captain.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:01.560
 All systems are dead.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.940
 Jim, we've got to do something.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:21.520
 Ah, humans.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.820
 Lovely, primitive humans.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.020
 Can't you do anything right?

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:28.960
 Please.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:32.040
 Of course, friend.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.960
 Of course.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:50.300
 Everything is working, my friends.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:51.480
 It cannot.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:54.260
 It is not logical.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:55.260
 Logic?

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.540
 Whose logic, my elfin friend?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:58.960
 Look around you, Spock.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:00.860
 Everything is working.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:01.700
 Welcome!

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:06.400
 I knew eventually humans would come searching for me.

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:07.960
 Who are you?

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.580
 Call me Lucien.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:10.920
 Call me friend.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.900
 Never could I abandon those who come to rollick with me.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.380
 But not up here.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.280
 No, no.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:22.240
 Let us leave this vessel and go where true delights lie.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:41.100
 Bones, you all right?

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.060
 Nothing wrong, Jim, but a face full of dust.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.240
 But if I had a medical tricorder...

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.640
 Jim, look at yourself.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.500
 Lucien, do something.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:52.920
 Very well, Captain.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:57.840
 I'd forgotten how much bodily integrity means to you humans.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:05.960
 This isn't easy, you know.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:09.240
 Holding us together like this, it's not even natural.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:12.900
 Being in one piece is very natural where we come from.

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:16.180
 I find this all quite absorbing, Doctor.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.220
 Probably because you're not very natural to begin with, Spock.

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:26.300
 Look, Lucien, or whatever you want to call yourself, I want to know why you brought us here.

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:36.600
 Children will play.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:41.040
 Is this better, my friends?

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:45.580
 I've translated my world into symbols your minds can understand.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.920
 Welcome, my friends, to Magus 2.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:53.300
 And just exactly what is Magus 2.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:08:00.940
 A world, Captain James Kirk, that operates by rules quite different from those in your universe.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:08.660
 Our universe operates by what you superstitiously call magic.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:13.640
 I know this is just my imagination, but...

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.720
 It is real, Doctor.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:15.860
 It is real, Doctor.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:16.060
 It is beautiful, Doctor.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:16.660
 Beautiful?

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:16.860
 Beautiful?

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:17.780
 No.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:23.020
 But all our women are as young and beautiful as they want to be.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:27.280
 So as to ensnare the man of her dreams, she needs an edge.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:30.200
 A love filter?

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.300
 Never settle for anything less.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:35.420
 Do you need a room, a stable, a castle?

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.000
 Stop in at your friendly sorcerer contractor.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.880
 Let him do the work.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:46.320
 Of course, our Federation scientists were more correct than they realized.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:53.160
 In order to function, the galactic creation point must extend through space, time,

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:57.980
 into another dimension where the logic of things is totally different.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.820
 It took magic to get your vessel working again.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:04.840
 Magic, you, my friends, don't know how to work.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:07.320
 But then you never did know, did you?

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:12.040
 Lucien, you keep calling us friends, implying that you know us.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:13.500
 How?

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:19.700
 Ah, Captain, Captain, do feign such ignorance to me.

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:22.800
 Very well.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:24.060
 Look.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:35.040
 Magus II may seem to you a chaotic world, but its people are calm, peaceful, contemplative.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:39.080
 Each, a specialist in his own kind of magic.

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:43.340
 There are no rivals anywhere in our universe, Captain Kirk.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:46.080
 No other life forms at all.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:53.800
 Millennia ago, in our search for companionship, we Magans passed through the point between dimensions,

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:59.500
 and eventually we found ourselves on your world, Earth.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.540
 Wherever we went, we became advisors to mankind.

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:12.220
 To help your ancestors, we drew on the power left behind in our own universe and made it work in your world.

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:15.840
 But eventually, we had to leave.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.700
 I didn't want to, my friends.

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:20.020
 Oh, how I fought.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:25.100
 I was the generalist amid all the specialists.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.020
 The troublemaker, they said.

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.660
 But I'd always loved the people of Earth.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.300
 Those were the days.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:38.900
 But now you've come to me, and I'm so very glad.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.980
 But why did you Magans leave Earth?

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.240
 If you enjoyed it so much, I don't understand.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.760
 Captain, good captain.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.760
 Always so curious.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:54.120
 That must be why I've always liked you, Earthlings, so much.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:57.120
 No!

00:10:58.460 --> 00:10:59.420
 You must go!

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:00.400
 What is it?

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:00.960
 What's wrong?

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:02.600
 You must return to your vessel.

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:03.220
 Quickly!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.020
 Do not give your presents away!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:08.400
 Captain!

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:09.680
 Captain Kirk, what?

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.000
 Everyone on board is all right?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:12.500
 Fine, Captain, but you?

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.640
 Mr. Scott, I'm bewildered, that's all.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:15.520
 But that's enough.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.460
 What did he mean, we're not to give ourselves away?

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.420
 Can't they detect the ship up here?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:21.920
 No, unless they have scanners.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:22.900
 See there?

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.780
 It's like a cloud of some kind.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:27.540
 It's been between us and the planet since you vanished.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.060
 If Lucian put it there...

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:33.400
 If Lucian put it there, Captain, the questions become,

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.720
 why is he hiding us?

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:40.700
 And what is our danger if discovered by the rest of his people?

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.120
 Weapons status, Mr. Scott.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:43.800
 We may have to protect ourselves.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:45.000
 No way, Captain.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.620
 Everything's out but life support systems,

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.980
 and I can't figure out how they're on.

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:57.620
 I believe this is how the ancients used to draw their mystic symbols, Captain.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.120
 Spock, do you honestly believe that as long as we're in this universe,

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.080
 we can work magic, too?

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:05.500
 One uses the resources at hand, Captain.

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:06.500
 Watch now.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:11.820
 I will attempt to move a Vulcan chess piece magically.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:19.120
 May the energy of this universe be the power in me.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:25.200
 Get it, Spock.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.040
 It won't work.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.840
 It must work, Doctor.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.880
 It is logical.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.320
 Here.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:34.240
 Power of this universe.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:36.580
 Enter my being.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.920
 I know I can.

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:44.640
 I believe I can.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:02.540
 Captain's log supplemental.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.800
 In this incredible universe, it appears to be a part of the natural laws

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:11.680
 that belief is as potent a force as energy and matter are in our own.

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:21.820
 Good luck.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.080
 What are you doing?

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.940
 Learning to protect ourselves, Lucian.

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:28.520
 Protect yourselves?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.000
 Is that all human beings ever think about?

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:34.440
 I'll take care of you.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.520
 That's what friends are for.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.580
 All this mental energy you're using,

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.160
 it can be traced.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.160
 You'll be found.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.900
 Have been found.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:46.760
 So,

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.640
 the people of Earth would spread their evil to our home.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:54.940
 We are ready for human perfidy this time.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:56.620
 This time,

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:58.940
 it is the humans who shall suffer.

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:00.300
 The humans,

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.600
 and you, Lucian,

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:04.200
 who shall pay.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:22.980
 Keep calm.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:23.020
 Keep calm.

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:55.780
 It looks like ancient Earth, Spock.

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.940
 16th or 17th century, I'd guess.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:00.480
 Approximately 1691, Captain.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:01.900
 Salem, Massachusetts.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:05.040
 If I recall your historical records correctly.

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:08.020
 We are gathered here today,

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:08.960
 good citizens,

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.860
 to see justice done.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:12.920
 You are the judges.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.360
 These are the defendants.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:19.780
 As representatives of the vile of the species

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.200
 in all the universe.

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:23.220
 Treacherous humanity.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.320
 And those who would aid them.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:30.160
 As a specialist in the ethics of magic,

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:33.040
 I have been appointed prosecutor here.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:33.700
 Wait.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:34.960
 If this is a trial,

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:35.820
 we have the right to know

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.000
 what you think we've done.

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.640
 Has this one not told you

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.580
 how we visited your Earth?

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:42.900
 Or what was done to us there?

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:44.700
 Lucian has said only

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.260
 that you came as wise men,

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.360
 helpful wizards.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.100
 Then hear this.

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:52.460
 Know that once upon your world,

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.400
 I was known as Asmodeus.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:00.260
 He who sees all gaze upon my countenance

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:02.460
 so that you too may see.

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:07.120
 We came to your world as friends.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.200
 But wherever we went,

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:11.820
 the story was invariably the same.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.900
 Some humans would attempt to use us

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.000
 to gain power,

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.960
 to serve their own greed and lust.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.700
 When we refused to serve them,

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.260
 they turned against us

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:24.340
 and taught other humans

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:26.020
 to fear us, to hate.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.360
 They called us devils,

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.380
 warlocks, evil sorcerers.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:33.160
 Those of us who survived

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.860
 came to the town of Salem

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.400
 in Massachusetts as settlers

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.920
 and tried to live like other men.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:40.220
 But you made mistakes.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.020
 Used your powers.

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:43.600
 And burned for it.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.080
 Burned.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.420
 As witches.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.100
 We massed together

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:49.540
 outside the town.

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:52.380
 Immersed ourselves in Megan lore.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.400
 Revived ourselves enough

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.760
 to unite our minds

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.800
 and reach into our own universe.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:16:59.800
 Tap enough of its power

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:01.740
 to return from your hellish earth

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:02.920
 to Magus II.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.120
 And loneliness and fear.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.280
 Should we not fear the earthlings?

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.200
 Should we not fear

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.640
 the cruelty of outsiders?

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.680
 Never again have we explored.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.100
 Never again has companionship

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:16.720
 been sought.

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.160
 Yet, here you are.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:21.880
 And if one earth ship

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.560
 can find us, friend Kirk,

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:25.380
 then so can others.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.240
 That's what they fear.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.300
 We do not want to hurt you.

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:33.360
 We have never had to hurt anyone before.

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.340
 If there were some reason not to,

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.620
 who will speak in defense

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:40.880
 of the earth humans?

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.080
 I will, Asmodeus.

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:45.120
 I am not of earth.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.780
 Yes, you are different.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:52.360
 The court will hear a defense.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:59.500
 I call Lucian as my first witness.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.700
 Lucian, you alone,

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.180
 of all those here,

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:07.820
 do not seem to fear

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.240
 or hate humans.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:10.700
 Why?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:11.960
 They are like me.

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:12.660
 They are like me,

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:15.280
 with questions to be answered,

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.760
 with minds that range outward,

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.060
 boundless.

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:21.760
 But every Megan is always alone

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.940
 in his sphere of knowledge.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.940
 Humans are always together.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:28.420
 They share.

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:30.880
 That is why I adopted your ship

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.140
 when I saw it arrive.

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:33.420
 Thank you, Lucian.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:35.680
 Next witness, please.

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:37.700
 Captain James T. Kirk.

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.580
 Tell the court, please, Captain Kirk.

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:43.860
 Would you say that since Salem,

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.700
 humans have changed?

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:49.260
 I think we've been trying to, Spock.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.020
 Humans have their faults,

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.040
 greed, envy, panicky fear.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.000
 But in the centuries

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.460
 since the Salem witch trials

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.380
 we have learned,

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.360
 we try to understand

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:01.560
 and respect all life forms.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:02.760
 Indeed, Captain.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.560
 Could you elaborate?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:06.040
 The records of the Enterprise

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.400
 are open for your inspection.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:09.260
 All the history of Earth

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:10.060
 and the Federation

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.220
 is at your disposal.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:11.580
 Look.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.700
 Look at General Order No. 1.

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.520
 No starship may interfere

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:17.660
 with the normal development

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:19.640
 of any alien life or society.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.680
 Compare that with the Earth

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:22.520
 you once knew.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:23.420
 Enough.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.580
 Here is your history.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.700
 Here are your records.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.080
 Citizens, you have heard.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:31.000
 You have read.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:32.700
 How do you vote?

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:40.460
 According to your records,

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:41.860
 your entry here

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.140
 was an accident

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.020
 unlikely to be duplicated.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.780
 With that in mind,

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.280
 plus all you have said,

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:49.720
 it seems to us

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.460
 that Megas 2 is safe.

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:54.800
 but Lucian must be punished.

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:57.520
 For his betrayal of his people,

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.280
 he shall be confined in limbo

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.820
 for all eternity

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:05.300
 to live with only himself.

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:06.460
 No.

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:10.000
 To isolate someone like Lucian,

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:11.340
 that's the same

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:12.600
 as sentencing him to death.

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:13.880
 Do you realize

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.000
 who you defend?

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.540
 He has told you

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:18.860
 his name is Lucian.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.420
 Would you defend him still

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:21.980
 if you knew

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.460
 he had another name, too?

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:24.800
 The Rolliker.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:26.000
 The Tempter.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:27.280
 Lucifer.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:30.760
 We're not interested

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:31.300
 in legend.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:32.960
 He's a living being

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.520
 in intelligent life form.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:35.600
 That's all we have

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.280
 to know about him.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.560
 We will not join

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:39.420
 in harming him.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.380
 Submit, Captain.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.080
 You haven't the power

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.140
 to fight us.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:46.940
 Captain,

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.960
 use the magic you know.

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:50.200
 Believe.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:21:06.480
 You cannot beat

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:07.680
 an entire planet,

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:08.520
 Captain Kirk.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.360
 There is no way

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.160
 you can win.

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:13.020
 I have to.

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:14.680
 Or you'll become

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:15.380
 as bad

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.220
 as the Earthmen

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:16.900
 you fear.

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:18.960
 You're acting

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:19.700
 out of terror

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:20.980
 instead of out of thought.

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:23.280
 For respect.

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.780
 You were prepared

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:34.400
 to die for Lucian,

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:35.780
 a being

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:37.240
 who is alien to you?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.940
 As I was sure

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:39.620
 you would,

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:40.440
 friend Kirk.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:41.900
 I told them

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:42.640
 their fears

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:43.680
 were groundless.

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:44.920
 I don't understand.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:46.160
 This last

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:46.920
 was a test

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:48.100
 of your intentions,

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:48.620
 Captain.

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:50.480
 We had to be certain

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:51.280
 your records

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.340
 were no ruse.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:53.720
 We have been

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:54.720
 tricked before,

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:55.880
 much to our

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:57.280
 pain and sorrow.

00:21:57.680 --> 00:21:58.180
 I see.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:21:59.580
 The Magans

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:00.500
 had to have proof

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:01.280
 that mankind

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:02.000
 had grown

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.000
 and learned wisdom

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.480
 since they last

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:05.120
 saw Earth.

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:06.680
 Your compassion

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:08.380
 was that proof,

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:08.920
 Captain.

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:10.300
 If your people

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.240
 should visit us

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:11.700
 now,

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:13.260
 we shall do

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:13.820
 our best

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:14.680
 to welcome them.

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:16.400
 The banishment

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:17.180
 of fear

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:18.500
 will help us all.

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:21.200
 A favorite

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:22.040
 old Earth

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:23.140
 custom of mine,

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:23.860
 Asmodeus.

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:25.180
 A toast

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:26.520
 to a new

00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:27.300
 friendship.

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:35.120
 All systems go,

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:35.380
 Captain.

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:36.580
 We're back to normal.

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:37.640
 No more magic

00:22:37.640 --> 00:22:38.440
 for us, Jim.

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:40.180
 It's all

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:40.820
 back there.

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:42.580
 You think

00:22:42.580 --> 00:22:43.260
 Lucian really

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:44.300
 was the demon

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:44.940
 and some men

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:45.800
 call Lucifer.

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:46.780
 Does it really

00:22:46.780 --> 00:22:47.440
 matter, Bones?

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:48.500
 It just might,

00:22:48.620 --> 00:22:48.800
 Captain.

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:50.520
 If he was,

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:51.700
 this would be

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:52.500
 the second time

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:53.780
 Lucifer was cast out.

00:22:54.180 --> 00:22:55.080
 And thanks to you,

00:22:55.760 --> 00:22:56.660
 the first time

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:58.180
 he was saved.

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:28.160
 The End

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:58.160
 The End

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:08.180
 The End

